/* ── Help dialog ───────────────────────────────────────── */
"help_dialog_title"    = "How to Use";
"help_steps_header"    = "📋 How to Use";
"help_steps_text"      = "① Tap ▶ Start Recording and perform your form\n② Pitching: cocking position (throwing elbow in \"L\" shape) through follow-through\n   Batting: setup stance through follow-through\n③ Tap ⏹ Stop Recording when done\n④ The app automatically splits the motion into 8 phases\n⑤ Tap any Phase 1–8 to switch its detailed breakdown and tips (the worst-scoring phase is shown first)";
"help_coach_header"    = "🤖 About the AI Coach";
"help_coach_text"      = "The coach is powered by AI trained on a vast dataset of professional baseball players.\n\nThousands of frames of pitching and batting motion — joint coordinates, elbow angles, shoulder and hip alignment, knee flex — were analysed with machine learning to derive statistically optimal form parameters.\n\nIn real time, your skeleton is detected by the camera and each of the 5 key angles is compared against the AI's ideal values, scoring your form from 0 to 100.";
"help_tips_header"     = "📌 Tips";
"help_tips_text"       = "• Face the camera directly (front view)\n• Stand far enough that your full body is visible\n• 🟢 Green skeleton = your actual form\n• 🔵 Cyan skeleton = AI coach ideal form\n• Record at least 2–3 seconds for reliable 8-phase sampling\n• Every phase (1–8) gets its own diagnosis and advice";
"help_controls_header" = "🎛️ Controls";
"help_controls_text"   = "📷 Camera Switch Button\n• Tap the camera icon to switch between front and rear camera.\n• Cannot switch while recording.\n\n🕐 Auto-Stop Toggle\n• ON: Recording stops automatically after 7 seconds.\n• OFF: Recording continues until you tap Stop manually.";

